  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine blueberries and strawberries in a bowl; spoon ½ into ice cream cone. Add 1 tablespoon whipped topping. Repeat layering with remaining ½ berries and remaining 1 tablespoon whipped topping; top with sprinkles.",
